{"v":4,"catch":"為什麼要吃披薩？因為太棒了！","desc":"你是在披薩店工作的送貨員之一，你需要快點，因為披薩可能會變冷。 “Why Pizza?”同時是一個平台遊戲、物理謎題和快遞工作模擬器。你必須送披薩，拿到報酬，才能活下來。如果你沒有足夠的錢，你將失去你的房子、食物和生命，所以要小心，努力工作！其中包括俗氣的古怪角色、有趣的關卡和熱披薩。","publisher":"Sometimes You","release":"2022-06-23","genres":["街機","益智","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.6GB / Switch 0.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3e08d939aa59a94a3c4961a95b1dbc12e46c77a3ea31eafb2db8a56f791e8552.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e3e508df82e329e68c5a7d68a8e3bb507ab6586a57737539beb46289a27f1144.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/59b56d7717169f9151e576215b80a8f57f8b520a6af1cd34c5fe13aeb5bb6c06.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c9bd9e6c1a21d34e3fd0f66526ad50c1bbec28a461d28ff5b04b36f0ee7717a7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cc2b30fb4bf9036775e3a55d812bef1a9a1129ecb1ba9f49d455c8ac5f078693.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/95be4b89dafc215de3815ad8efe9bf3f640ce2007e6970d9883dceabea6abaa0.jpg"],"titleId":"010099c016e2a000","dlc":[]}